Z||000000||GT Bastard||08-27-2001||03:15 PM||||It's been 4 months since my SE last drove to it's final resting spot at the end of my driveway.  I really really miss driving her now!  I had origionally thought that 500 bucks would get my motor rebuilt, but I ended up getting all the expensive machine work done, and I'm in the process of paying off the machine shop.  It sucks having wasted the entire summer without the car.  I'm driving an '85 SE V5 with a 4sp, but it's not the same as driving my other SE since this one is stock. Everyone else is out there playing with their hopped-up toys and I'm driving a stock Fiero... What's the max you guys have had to go without your Fiero?<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gtbastard.gif">     <P>"My heroes are John Wayne, the Simpsons, and whoever canceled Full House/Bob Saget."||||reg||13
