Z||000007||Fformula88||08-27-2001||04:34 PM||||I've owned the Fiero for a little over 4 years (51 months about) and managed to get about 14,000 miles on it.  I do without it every year thru the snowy winter months Oct/Nov thru Mar/Apr and didn't even have it registered while I was at school the first two years I owned it (Sept-May).  The summers have been trying too with many small problems I have worked on since buying it.<P>I am so happy now that I have finally gotten it up and running.  Just in time for winter again!  <P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierosig2.JPG"> <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
