Z||000012||fierobear||08-27-2001||06:24 PM||||My worst stretch was when all three of my running cars were out at once. All were at the Fiero Shop at one time:<P>Formula: old 2.8 was shot, waiting for a 3.4<P>86 coupe: my wife's daily driver, rear ended by a dickhead who then drove away. I lent her my GT, then...<P>GT: Some idiot backed into my wife in a parking lot.<P>3 cars, all down at once. I'm pleased to report that all four of my running cars are up and running, the forth being an Indy that I'm restoring back to health. It still needs a lot of work, but I can and do drive it around the block once a week.||||reg||1
