Z||000023||StuGood||08-28-2001||12:45 AM||||About nine months without my 1987 GT.  Frustrating, because every time I meet a Fiero on the street, I think, "If I were driving the GT, I would've hit the "winky light."  Started out to replace valve seals and broken exhaust manifold bolts... but the job seems to keep expanding as I find more things to clean and fix up.<P>Plus, I was completely Fieroless for awhile when I had to travel to Seattle for my job.  That was no fun.<P>But just wait!  Before too long, the ol' GT will be back on the road!  And then I'll be re-clutching the 1986 SE...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>  ||||reg||9
